    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Buggy are delighted to bring to the market Lindon Cottage a charming detached two-bedroom bungalow situated in a peaceful countryside setting.\r\nThe property has been completely refurbished by the current owners and offers comfortable and well-maintained accommodation throughout, comprising a fully fitted kitchen with tiled flooring, dining room with tiled flooring, living room with timber flooring and a solid fuel stove, two bedrooms, bathroom and utility room.\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a private driveway and garden, providing ample outdoor space. A particular feature of the property is the large detached sheds, which are wired for electricity and offer excellent potential for multiple uses, including storage, a workshop or hobby space.\r\nThe bungalow benefits from triple-glazed windows and oil-fired central heating, providing a comfortable home throughout the year.\r\nLindon Cottage enjoys an attractive rural setting in the Ballyloo/Nurney area while remaining within convenient reach of Carlow town and the surrounding villages. Our Lady’s National School, Nurney is located nearby, while Carlow town offers a wide selection of schools, supermarkets, shops, restaurants and other everyday amenities.\r\nThe property is well positioned for access to the surrounding road network, with local routes providing connections towards Carlow town, and providing easy access to the M9 motorway.\r\nAll of these features combine to make this attractive detached bungalow an ideal starter home, a comfortable family residence, or an attractive option for those looking to downsize and enjoy the benefits of village living.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing recommended, contact sole selling agents, Property Partners Buggy Auctioneers on 057 8606980."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3m x 1m\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.4m x 2.6m\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5m x 3.15m\r\n\r\nUtility - 2m x 2m\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.4m x 2.1m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.5m x 2.6m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.6 m x 1.6m\r\n\r\nShed - 9.7m x 6m\r\n\r\nShed 2 3.5m x 2.5m\r\n\r\nShed 3 3.3m x 2.5m"
